# WebKitGTK (the webkit2gtk-4.1 API) against mlibc, static, with ICU,
# libgpg-error, libgcrypt and libtasn1, toward surf (issue #616): build
# output in target/webkitgtk-mlibc-<arch>. No app: its programs, linked
# from its archive, are packages of their own (webkitgtk-smoke, surf).
PORT_CORE=0
PORT_LIBC=mlibc
PORT_DEPS="mlibc libcxx glib image-libs cairo-pango x11-xft gtk3 libsoup libressl sqlite"
PORT_BUILD=build.sh
PORT_OUTPUTS="webkitgtk-mlibc-{arch}"
PORT_READY="webkitgtk-mlibc-{arch}/lib/libwebkit2gtk-4.1.a"
# ICU's data (share/icu-data) is the programs' packages' to ship: they
# open it in /lib/webkitgtk.
PORT_FILES=""
# One CI job per arch (a WebKit build takes hours), each cached apart.
PORT_ARCH_JOBS=1
PORT_TIMEOUT=340
